# Allowlist, not a blocklist. The build context otherwise carries 1.5 GB of
# downloaded terraform providers, a 282 MB virtualenv, and -- the reason this
# file is written this way round -- config.toml and *.pem, which are the live
# org's credentials. A blocklist protects you until somebody adds a file nobody
# thought to exclude; this one admits nothing that is not named.
*

!src/
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
